      "text": "Let's get a CT scan of the abdomen, for right iliac fossa tenderness. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Even though you look fairly well, I'd like the surgeons to see you today. I'd like to see you again straight away. Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
